turing and how important it was  to national security and to our economic  vitality absolutely not  we've been trying to get something in  place for over two years and the Trump  administration in the last what 14 seven  months has put this in place and got  this going this ball rolling for us so  this is this is great not only for ha  before the aluminum industry in the US  and the dumping of a glut and aluminum  production worldwide from China to other  countries has depressed the price  American companies can't compete but  what what the critics of these tariffs  say is oh all the products that we make  are just gonna be a lot more expensive  now you're going to be hurting the  mom-and-pop consumers to what you what  do you say we have a premium product in  no way else in the world can produce and  that is the highest grade aluminum in  the world and it goes to our military in  our aerospace without that where do you  get that aluminum  we're not gonna get it from China we  don't want to buy it from China for that  oh hey dusty it was great to see you  there today man and keep doing what  you're doing it's really a pleasure  thank you

